<title>USA: TABLE - Twinlab Q2 oper income increases.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Twinlab Q2 oper income increases.</headline>
<dateline>RONKONKOMA, N.Y. 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p>Pro forma shr profit</p>
<p>				$0.18   profit	 $0.14</p>
<p> Net profit		 4,738     loss	 4,322</p>
<p>Operating income profit</p>
<p>				4,738   profit	 3,673</p>
<p> Revs			44,567		   37,853</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  27,025		   27,000</p>
<p>	   6 MONTHS</p>
<p>Pro forma shr profit</p>
<p>				$0.39   profit	 $0.30</p>
<p> Net profit		10,405   profit	 5,457</p>
<p>Operating income profit</p>
<p>			     10,405   profit	 8,079</p>
<p> Revs			95,736		   81,837</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  27,020		   27,000</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE:  Twinlab Corp said it reported 1996 pro forma results for reacapitalization, a tax status change and an initial public offering as if they occurred as of January 1, 1996.</p>
<p>Net income for the second quarter and first six months of 1996 included $15.3 million for a nonrecurring non-competititon agreement expense.</p>
<p>Net income for the first six months of 1996 also includes $400,000 for nonrecurring transaction expenses.</p>
<p>Operating income includes the effect of the reacapitalization, the tax status change and the initial public offering and excludes the nonrecurring items in 1996.</p>
</text>
